op in these  communities or refusing to open up in  the first place  maybe this is part of the reason why  I mean when you Prey Upon the businesses  in your community  and you Loot and Rob them then they're  going to go away and and then other  potential business owners are going to  look and they just if you've got someone  who wants to open up  their own restaurant their own grocery  store and they're trying they're  thinking of where should I put it  they're going to tend to put it in safer  places  where they're less likely to be  victimized in this way  seems rather obvious I realize but you  know still needs to be pointed out  against  that'll do it for this portion of the  show as we move over to the members  block and you can become a member and  use code wall should check out for two  months free on all annual plans hope to  see you over there if not talk to you  tomorrow Godspeed  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]

